CORE
initial1.sv
--aiger --top main
^aag [0-9]+ [0-9]+ 2 0 [0-9]+ 2$
^[0-9]+ [0-9]+ 1$
^([0-9]+) [0-9]+ \1$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
A latch with an initial value is exported with that value as AIGER 1.9
reset value, "lit next 1" for r1, and a latch without initial value is
uninitialised, "lit next lit" for r2.
